62134	Q0	zis308_exz	24	1.5999749	instruments_tools	The ICT SC25 is a 25 item scale to economically processing time 1 min per scale assess com petence self concept SC related to the use of information and communication technology ICT available in the two languages German ICT SC25g and English ICT SC25e . The ICT SC25g e measures general and domain specific ICT SC communicate process and store generate content safe application and solve problems in the adult population 18 69 years across contexts private life work and education . The present study documents the development and validation of the ICT SC25g e. The results indicate good reliability internal consistency test retest reliability . Confirma tory factor analyses support factorial validity and theory consistent relations with personality traits e.g. emotional stability and technology related measures e.g. frequency of ICT use technopho bia confirm construct validity. The scale shows strict measurement invariance across gender and countries.
