62134	Q0	zis58	51	1.0551871	instruments_tools	The scale measures anomie the perceived normlessness with four items. The development of the items is based on the work of Srole 1956 . The scale was used several times in a general population survey called Allgemeinen Bevölkerungsumfrage ALLBUS .
62134	Q0	zis151	52	1.0517354	instruments_tools	The items documented here capture emotional affective dimensions of identification with one s own nation and thus a central dimension of self group orientations. A positive development of such orientations is a prerequisite for national identity and patriotic attitudes. In extreme cases however they can also favour the formation of nationalistic values or ethnocentric tendencies which according to empirical studies are often associated with generalised negative prejudices and intolerance towards members of certain population groups institutions or states.
62134	Q0	sg-34	53	1.0475295	instruments_tools	Interviewers are involved in nearly all aspects of the implementation process in interviewer administered surveys. Therefore they have a significant influence on data quality. Involved interviewers should attend standardized and qualified interviewer training before fieldwork to achieve high data quality. This survey guideline provides the general part of such training. The guideline consists of two documents I a set of slides which can be used for the training after project specific adaptations and II an explanation about the conceptual background of the training. The training is based on the modular structure of the General Interviewer Training Curriculum for Computer Assisted Personal Interviews GIT CAPI .
