1537	Q0	zis192	17	1.0711057	instruments_tools	With eight items this scale measures attitudes to the services and functions of the welfare and welfare state. The attitudes towards the welfare state are to be regarded as indicators for social value orientations which can be seen as a subjective evaluation of the social structure.
