185	Q0	zis75	63	1.0203586	instruments_tools	The scale of law and order positions captures the general tendency to ward off everything foreign and threatening combined with the demand for the use of state means of power. The development of the scale is based on work by Fend. The scale was developed in the Youth and Violence Project at Bielefeld University.
185	Q0	zis176	64	1.0203586	instruments_tools	With six items the scale measures the perception of problems on a global level. This corresponds to the perception of the current state of our environment from an ecological point of view and forms the starting point for norm activation. The development of the scale is based on the works of Schwartz 1977 1981 .
