30368	Q0	zis176	39	1.0203586	instruments_tools	With six items the scale measures the perception of problems on a global level. This corresponds to the perception of the current state of our environment from an ecological point of view and forms the starting point for norm activation. The development of the scale is based on the works of Schwartz 1977 1981 .
