557	Q0	zis216	9	1.9009182	instruments_tools	The construct of realistic educational aspirations is primarily used to record the educational decisions intended by the parents or adolescents surveyed. The research interest focuses on an analysis of the determinants of educational behaviour and in particular on clarifying the causes of the influence of families of origin on the demand for higher education.
