557	Q0	zis50	41	1.0489472	instruments_tools	The questionnaire records the tendency towards self monitoring. In addition to an overall value the four subscales Acting Extraversion Other Directedness and Sensitivity for expressive behavior and social cues are mapped. The development of the scale is based on the work of Snyder 1974 .
